\\ attach: module-style import (like Python's import)
\\ Functions are namespaced, top-level code does NOT execute
\\ attach "utils.astra" as u
\\ u.someFunction()

\\ include: full merge (like C's #include)
\\ Executes everything in the included file, exactly where placed
\\ include "config.astra"

write "See README.md for attach vs include details"
